=2 Walkthrough
* Redeem the {@k} {k:Behemoth key} at the {p:Tenshodo} in {z:Lower Jeuno} for your reward.

=2 Reaugmenting
* The easiest way to repeat the fight to change your augmented item is to first toss it.
** At max level, you only need 1 tablet to get the cutscene from the **Mahogany Door**: one possible way is to warp to {z:Den of Rancor} Home Point #1, exit south via the switch, grab the {@k} {k:Tablet of Hexes: Blight} at (H-9), warp back to {z:Den of Rancor} Home Point #1, and continue to the {z:Sacrificial Chamber}.
** Alternatively purchase the hex tablets from {n:Squintrox Dryeyes} in {z:Port Jeuno} for 2,000 Gil and 20 {i:Beastmen Seals|Beastmen's Seal|1126}.
* Ensure any previous {@k} {p:Tonberry key (Shantotto)} has been consumed using the Red Chest in {p:Tenshodo} in {z:Lower Jeuno}.
* If you have a {@k} {p:Tonberry key (Shantotto)} already you will not be able to enter the BCNM until it is used.
* This will allow you to enter the BCNM in {z:Sacrificial Chamber}. After the fight, you will immediately receive the {@k} {p:Tonberry key (Shantotto)} and {@k} {k:Behemoth key}.

